        {
          "id": 93486,
          "content": "<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Nunito-ExtraBold; background-color: #ba372a; color: #ffffff; font-size: 16pt;\"> <strong>VOCABULARY</strong> </span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #ffffff; font-family: Nunito-ExtraBold; color: #ffffff; font-size: 16pt;\"> <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #000000;\">HEALTH AND ILLNESS</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Bold;\">A. How are you today?</span><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"> </em></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(</em></span><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Hôm nay bạn khỏe không?)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">I'm <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">very well</strong></em>, thanks. <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Mình rất khỏe, cảm ơn nhé.)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">I'm <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">fine</strong></em>, thanks. <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Mình ổn, cảm ơn nha.)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">I don't feel very well. I must go home and rest. <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Mình thấy trong người không khỏe. Mình phải về nhà nghỉ ngơi thôi. (Chắc mai mình sẽ ổn.))</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">I feel <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">ill</strong></em>. Can you get a <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">doctor</strong></em>, please? (Perhaps it's a serious problem.)<em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"> (Mình ốm rồi. Bạn có thể gọi bác sĩ cho mình không? (Đây có thể là vấn đề nghiêm trọng.))</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">That fish was bad. I think I'm going to be <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">sick</strong></em>! (I want to vomit.) <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Món cá đó dở tệ thật sự. Tôi nghĩ tôi sẽ ói mất! (Tôi muốn ói))</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"> </p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Bold;\"><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">B. Everyday problems</span></strong></span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"> </strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(</em></span><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Một số bệnh hay gặp)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><img src=\"https://img.freepik.com/free-vector/hands-with-medicine-bottles-prescription_603843-3827.jpg\" alt=\"hands with medicine bottles prescription\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" /> </span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">Have you got an <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">aspirin</strong></em>? I've got a <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">headache</strong></em>. <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important; color: #c0392b;\">/ˈhed.eɪk/<em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"> (</em></span><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Bạn có thuốc giảm đau không? Mình bị đau đầu rồi.)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><img src=\"https://img.freepik.com/premium-vector/illustration-expression-young-man-with-swollen-cheeks-due-toothache_10045-579.jpg\" alt=\" illustration of expression of young man with swollen cheeks due to toothache\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" /></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">I've got a <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">toothache</strong></em>. <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important; color: #c0392b;\">/ˈtuːθ.eɪk/</span> I need to go to the <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">dentist</strong></em>.  <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Mình bị đau răng. Mình cần tới gặp nha sĩ.)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><img src=\"https://img.freepik.com/free-vector/person-with-cold-illustration_23-2148478443.jpg\" alt=\"A person with a cold illustration\" width=\"78\" height=\"78\" /></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">I'm going to bed with a hot drink. I've got <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">a cold</strong></em>.<em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"> (Mình sẽ uống một nước nóng nóng trước khi đi ngủ. Mình bị cảm rồi.)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"> </p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Bold;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">C. Problems people have for many years / all their lives. </strong></span><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Một số bệnh mãn tính)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">I'm <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">allergic to</strong></em> cats. I <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">sneeze</strong></em> <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important; color: #c0392b;\">/sniːz/ </span>when I'm around them. (Tôi dị ứng với mèo. Tôi toàn bị hắt hơi khi ở gần chúng.)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">My little brother has <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">asthma</strong></em><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important; color: #c0392b;\"> /ˈæs.mə/</span>; sometimes he can't breathe. (Em trai tôi bị hen suyễn, thỉnh thoảng thằng bé lại bị khó thở.)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"> </p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Bold;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">D. Contagious diseases </strong></span>(Bệnh truyền nhiễm)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">In some countries, <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">mosquitoes</strong></em> can give people <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">malaria</strong></em>. <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important; color: #c0392b;\">/məˈleə.ri.ə/ (</span>Ở một số quốc gia, muỗi có gây bệnh sốt rét.)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">Millions of people died in the <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">coronavirus pandemic</strong></em>. (Hàng triệu người đã chết trong đại dịch Covid.)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"> </p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Bold; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">E. Expressions</strong></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">A: Do you <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">have a healthy diet</strong></em>? <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Bạn có ăn uống lành mạnh không?)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">B: Yes, I eat lots of fruit and vegetables. <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Có, mình ăn rất nhiều hoa quả và rau củ.)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">A: Do you <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">exercise</strong></em>? <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Bạn có tập thể dục không?)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">B: Yes, I like swimming, jogging and cycling. They're really good for you. <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Có, mình thích bơi, đi bộ và đạp xe. Những hoạt động này rất tốt cho bạn đó.)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">A: I feel <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">stressed</strong></em>! <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Mình thấy căng thẳng quá!)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">B: Do you? You need to <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">relax</strong></em> more and don't <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">panic</strong></em> about work! <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">(Thật vậy sao? Bạn cần thư giãn nhiều hơn và đừng quá lo âu vì công việc nữa!)</em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"> </em></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: Nunito-ExtraBold; font-size: 21.3333px; font-style: normal; background-color: #ba372a;\"> <strong>SPEAKING</strong> </span></em></span></span></p>",
