          "content": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e7965da7-7fff-e443-bcbb-30b7ad6e32f0\"></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: Nunito-ExtraBold;\">Exercise 1: Complete the dialogues with words below. </span><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">(Ho&agrave;n th&agrave;nh c&aacute;c đoạn hội thoại sau với c&aacute;c từ dưới đ&acirc;y.)</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f636cd6c-7fff-252f-0825-8d343d392bad\"></span></span></span></p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt;\" align=\"left\">\n<table style=\"border: none; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; width: 568.063pt; height: 19.1979px;\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /><col /></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.1979px;\">\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; height: 19.1979px; border: 1pt solid #000000;\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">fine</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; height: 19.1979px; border: 1pt solid #000000;\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">get</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; height: 19.1979px; border: 1pt solid #000000;\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">allergic</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; height: 19.1979px; border: 1pt solid #000000;\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">sick</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>",
