; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Poor you.</span><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">(Tội nghiệp bạn.) </span><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">I will bring these flowers out of this room.</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fa2fad54-7fff-2ce3-19b8-0ffc94ddd59a\" style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular; font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">A: Thank you.</span></p>\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-55461dec-7fff-874b-565e-7a3959786b77\" style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular; font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p>"
